    &lt;div style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"&gt;&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 34%; text-align: center"&gt;-6-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%; text-align: right"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"&gt;&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0.55pt 1.1pt 0; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NORTHWESTERN WISCONSIN ELECTRIC &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;COMPANY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 3.8pt 1.25pt 0 1.1pt; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES TO THE FINANCIAL &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;STATEMENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 4.05pt 0.15pt 0 1.25pt; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;December 31, 2025 and &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #000001"&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;DEFERRED CHARGES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;(Continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;The
COVID-19 related amount is the late fees and associated costs the company was not allowed to charge customers during the pandemic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #3A2621"&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;The Public Service Commission of Wisconsin directed the Company to amortize these costs over &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;five
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;years effect&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;ve December 4,
2025.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;The
storm damage &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;repair &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;costs are costs incurred to&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;restore
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;power to customers due to damage from a significant ice and snow storm which occurred in December
of 2022. The Publ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;c Service Comm&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;ssion
of W&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;sconsin directed the Company to amortize these costs over
five years effective December 4, 2025.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;The
defined pension plan additional contribution is an additional funding contribution the Company&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;was
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;requ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;red to make to the plan.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;The &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;company offers elig&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;ble
employees the option of taking their pension payout &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;n the form
of an annuity or a lump sum payment. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;The &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;company has been notified
by &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;ts actuarial &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;firm &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;that
in order to provide the lump sum benefit option available w&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;th&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;in
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;the plan to all of &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;its &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;employees,
regardless of annual income, the plan must be &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;funded &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;at 110 percent
of the Internal Revenue Service defined pension &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;l&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;iability. During
2022, the company made the additional contribution of $293,000 to the defined pension p&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #2F3136"&gt;l&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;an.
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F28"&gt;The &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C1A"&gt;Public Service Commission of Wisconsin directed the Company
