&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE 4- LONG-TERM DEBT (Continued)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;The
series &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;M bond indenture &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;requires that while this &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;bond
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;is outstanding, the Company will maintain funded debt at a level no greater than 60% of total equity;
the Company will maintain tangible &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;net worth &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;of &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;not
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;less than $15,000,000; the Company will make plant capital and maintenance expenditures that average
at least 1.0 times the depreciation expense for any three year period; and the Company will not pay dividends in excess of 70% of accumulated
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;net &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;income after December 31, 2000. No violations of these &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;restrictions&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;have occurred at December 31, 2025.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: bold 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;NOTE 5- PENSION BENEFIT OBLIGATION&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Defined Benefit &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;Plan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;The
Company maintains a non-contributory defined benefit pension plan which covers all full time employees of eligible age. Annual contributions
are determined by actuarial valuations prepared by an independent consultant, and are based upon the projected unit credit cost method
for service cost and for the projected benefit obligation, and the unit credit cost method for the accumulated benefit obligation. Employer
contributions for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 were $333,750 and $380,000, respectively.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;The&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;Company expects to make contributions of $529,250 to the Plan &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;in&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;2026. All contributions are paid to and invested &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;by &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;an
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;independent insurance &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;company. Plan assets were valued as of
December 31, 2025 and 2024 and Plan&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #26212A"&gt;liabilities&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;were determined
as of January 1, 2025 and 2024, and &lt;/font&gt;projected to December 31, 2025 and &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;2024.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; color: #110C18"&gt;The
following sets forth the changes in the pension benefit obligation based on the actuary's analysis as of December 31:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

