&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; color: #130E18"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 11.5pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;5-&lt;/font&gt;	PENSION
BENEFIT OBLIGATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;(Continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-indent: 0pt; color: #130E18"&gt;Weighted average assumptions
used to determine benefit obligations were as follows for the years ended December 31:&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%"&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: bottom"&gt;
