&lt;p style="margin: 0"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%"&gt;
