&lt;p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;The Company has taken no uncertain tax positions
which it believes would require special disclosure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;div style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"&gt;&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 34%; text-align: center"&gt;-16-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%; text-align: right"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"&gt;&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0.55pt 1.1pt 0; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NORTHWESTERN WISCONSIN ELECTRIC &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;COMPANY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 3.8pt 1.25pt 0 1.1pt; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES TO THE FINANCIAL &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;STATEMENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 4.05pt 0.15pt 0 1.25pt; text-align: center; color: #110C18"&gt;&lt;b&gt;December 31, 2025 and &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2024&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    

&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: bold 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; color: #110C18"&gt;NOTE 10 - OPERATING &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;RATIOS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;On
December 4, 2025 the Public Service Commission of Wisconsin authorized the company to increase &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;rates
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;on average of 3.74%, authorizing 8.21% return on average investment &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;in
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;net utility plant and materials &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;inventory &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;and
10.00% &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;return &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;on average stockholder's equity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;As of&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A"&gt;December&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;31 the&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A"&gt;ratios&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;were as &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p style="margin: 0"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: bottom"&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding-bottom: 1pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"&gt;&lt;b&gt;2025&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding-bottom: 1pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"&gt;&lt;b&gt;2024&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr style="vertical-align: bottom"&gt;
    &lt;td style="width: 56%; text-align: left; padding-left: 4.9pt"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;Return on average investment&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A"&gt;in&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;net utility&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A"&gt;plant&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18"&gt;and&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;materials&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 8%"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 12%; text-align: right"&gt;7.63&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"&gt;%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 8%"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 12%; text-align: right"&gt;7.02&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"&gt;%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr style="vertical-align: bottom"&gt;
    &lt;td style="text-align: left; padding-left: 4.9pt"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #110C18; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Return on average&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: #241F2A; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;stockholders' equity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;7.81&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;7.10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;



&lt;p style="margin: 0"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 11pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;11-&lt;/font&gt;	DEFINED CONTRIBUTION &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;PLAN&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;The
Company also maintains a defined contribution 401(k) pension plan. Employee contributions to this plan are partially matched by company
contributions. The Company match is 40% for every dollar contributed, up to 6% of &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;income &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;for
a maximum Company exposure of 2.4% of eligible employee &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;payroll. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;This
plan is &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;available &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;to all full time Company employees. In 2025,
an employee could contribute up to the IRS maximum which was $23,500 to $31,000, depending on the employees age. Contributions are deposited
with an outside plan trustee, who is &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;responsible &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;for all investing,
&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;payment &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;o&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #33180F"&gt;f &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;proceeds,
and reporting. Contributions to the 401(k) plan by the Company for 2025 and 2024 were $72,825 and $71,084.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: bold 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; color: #110C18"&gt;NOTE 12 - &lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;COMMITMENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; color: #110C18"&gt;The
Company is committed to purchase its electric power and energy with various vendors through December 31, 2029.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: bold 11.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; color: #110C18"&gt;NOTE 13 - MAJOR SUPPLIER
&lt;font style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;INFORMATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10.5pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;The
Company purchased approximately 92% and 82% of its electric power &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #241F2A"&gt;from &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="color: #110C18"&gt;AEP
Energy Partners, Inc. and 6% and 12% from Xcel Energy for the year ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;div style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"&gt;&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 34%; text-align: center"&gt;-17-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width: 33%; text-align: right"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    

&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #08070A"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 13pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 12pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;font style="color: #08070A"&gt;SUPPLEMENTARY&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font style="color: #16161A; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;INFORMATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

